  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward when sentiment is neutral or negative (sentiment ≤ 0.00) to avoid overestimating price spikes.",
    "Reduce forecast bias by averaging the last 5-7 true values before the forecast horizon to capture mean reversion.",
    "Apply a lag correction: if true outcome is significantly higher than forecast, reduce next forecast by 5-10% to avoid overshoot after spikes.",
    "Increase forecast sensitivity to recent high true values when sentiment is positive (sentiment > 0.00) to capture momentum.",
    "Cap forecast increases above 10% of recent 30-day average to prevent overreaction to short-term volatility.",
    "When sentiment is positive and forecast is below recent low, apply a ‘rebound’ correction: add 2-5% to forecast to align with upward momentum."
  ]
}
